# Looking down over the city from the CD block hub's lift (BOOT_AT_HUB 1: stood facing west, 150
# short of the pad). Onto the pad, look down as it rises (B held: let go, the head comes back up),
# and turn: the city below must be there near and far, fogged out only in the distance (the user,
# 2026-11-16: "the city below when looking down is cut nearest to the player, that spans almost
# half of the city")
boot_at hub
wait_up
wait 1.0
hold up 0.45
wait 0.3
keydown b
wait 2.5
shot lld_01_low
wait 1.5
shot lld_02_rising
hold right 0.75
wait 0.3
shot lld_03_turned
hold right 0.75
wait 0.3
shot lld_04_turned
hold right 0.75
wait 0.3
shot lld_05_turned
wait 1.5
shot lld_06_top
keyup b
